                <head>Treaty between the United States and Japan providing for the protection of
                    trade-marks, etc., in China</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington May 19, 1908.
                        Ratification advised by the Senate May 20, 1908. Ratified by the President
                        June 2, 1908. Ratified by Japan August 8, 1908. Ratifications exchanged at
                        Tokyo August 6, 1908. Proclaimed August 11, 1908.</hi></p>

